<Layout title="Sponsorship">
  <main id="main" class="page">
    <header class="page-heading"><h1>Sponsorship</h1><p class="lede">Interested in supporting hands-on cybersecurity learning at NMSU?</p></header>
    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>Start a conversation</h2>
      <p>We're exploring what support for the club could look like. We don't currently have sponsors or a formal sponsorship program, but we'd be glad to hear from people and organizations interested in connecting.</p>
      <p><a href="mailto:cybersecurityclub@nmsu.edu?subject=Sponsorship%20inquiry">Email the club about sponsorship →</a></p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
